  m_text: "<color=#FF4343>Hold</color> Alt Fire to spray <color=#FF4343>gasoline</color>, making <color=#FF4343>non-flammable</color> enemies <color=#FF4343>flammable</color>.\n\nCan also be sprayed on the <color=#FF4343>environment</color> to create <color=#FF4343>walls of fire</color>."
