  m_text: "Press Alt Fire to throw a <color=#FF4343>coin</color>.\n\nHit an <color=#FF4343>airborne</color> coin to <color=#FF4343>deflect</color> your shot into the nearest enemy's <color=#FF4343>weakpoint</color>.\n\nCoins can be <color=#FF4343>chained</color>. "
