  m_text: "<b>! SAVE FAILED !</b>\n\nThe game is unable to finalize saving your progress.\n\n<b>COMMON REASONS FOR FAILURE:</b>\n1. Third party software (such as an antivirus) stopping the game from saving a new file\r\n\nIf this problem occurs again, make sure your antivirus or any similar software is not preventing the game from writing files\r\n\r\nIf you wish to try again,\r\npress <b>\"Y\"\r</b>\nIf you wish to continue without saving,\r\npress <b>\"N\"</b>\n\nSorry and thank you for your understanding. :)"
